hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"13","It is narrated from Sayyida Aisha (may Allah be pleased with her) that she stated regarding the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) that he would perform three rak‘ahs of Witr, would say salam after two rak‘ahs and would let us hear the words of salam, then would stand up and perform one rak‘ah."
"14","Sayyida Aisha (may Allah be pleased with her) narrates that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) would perform (three witr), and to separate the two and one rak'ah, he would say salam, and I, being at home, would hear your salam."
